# oracle: compute efield/wolf/atom (alpha 0.25; the whole system, and a group source with cutoff 2.2) on a displaced charged two-type fluid (fcc 0.8442, charges +0.5 / -0.5), 3 steps of nve; the field of each atom is dumped at step 3 and summed in thermo
# oracle: native: b332f28 (installed lmp; compute efield/wolf/atom is in the EXTRA-COMPUTE package of that binary)
# oracle-files: w227xc_efield_wolf.dump
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=none filerel=1e-12
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 1.6e-15, atoms n/a (atoms=none; the per-atom fields are the dump file, worst token 1.1e-12 on a component of 4e-4, i.e. 4e-16 absolute, from the summation order of the neighbours).
units           lj
atom_style      charge
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            * 1.0
region          left block INF 3.0 INF INF INF INF units lattice
group           gleft region left
set             group gleft type 2
set             type 1 charge 0.5
set             type 2 charge -0.5
variable        dx atom 0.1*sin(2.3*x+1.1*y+0.4*z)
variable        dy atom 0.1*cos(1.9*y-0.7*x+0.3*z)
variable        dz atom 0.1*sin(1.3*z+0.8*x-0.5*y)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
velocity        all create 1.0 87287 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/cut 2.5 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0
compute         ef all efield/wolf/atom 0.25
compute         efg all efield/wolf/atom 0.25 group gleft cutoff 2.2
compute         efS all reduce sum c_ef[1] c_ef[2] c_ef[3]
compute         efgS all reduce sum c_efg[1] c_efg[2] c_efg[3]
dump            d1 all custom 3 w227xc_efield_wolf.dump id c_ef[1] c_ef[2] c_ef[3] c_efg[1] c_efg[2] c_efg[3]
dump_modify     d1 sort id format float %.15g
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step pe ke c_efS[1] c_efS[2] c_efS[3] c_efgS[1] c_efgS[2] c_efgS[3]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          3
run             3
